{"id":"5ed7a378ff9d39c6","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-omega-model.md","title":"Omega Structures and Models","display":"df-omega-model — Omega Structures and Models","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-omega-model","aliases":["62-df-omega-model"],"display":"df-omega-model — Omega Structures and Models","depends_on":["[[62-df-L2-model]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2; Chapter VIII introduction","source_pages":[4,5,309],"source_pdf_pages":[22,23,327]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-omega-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-omega-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-model — Omega Structures and Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"087811585401a368\" href=\"?note=087811585401a368\" title=\"62-df-L2-model\">62-df-L2-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), §I.2; Chapter VIII introduction"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>4</span><span>5</span><span>309</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span><span>23</span><span>327</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>双类结构满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"087811585401a368\" href=\"?note=087811585401a368\" title=\"62-df-L2-model\">62-df-L2-model</a>，句子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}\\)</span>；数结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;)\">\\((\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;)\\)</span> 均为标准结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal S,+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal S,+,\\cdot,0,1,&lt;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaStruct}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S})\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OmegaStruct}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S})\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\\bot&amp;\\mathcal S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\models T&amp;\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\\bot&amp;\\mathcal S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\models T&amp;\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一阶部分为外部标准自然数；集合部分允许真子集。空集合域候选的 OmegaModelOf 规定为假，只有非空时才调用结构满足关系。补入原定义漏掉的非空集合域条件，并移除全二阶幂集量词的上游。任意这样的 ω 结构在元理论中满足每个固定公式的归纳实例，因为标准自然数没有真归纳初段；这不表示某个内部编码已经包含全体公式的真值集合。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），§I.2; Chapter VIII introduction；纸面页 4, 5, 309；PDF 页 22, 23, 327。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-L2-model","status":"resolved","id":"087811585401a368","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2-model","status":"resolved","id":"087811585401a368","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"双类结构满足关系见 [[62-df-L2-model]]，句子见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$；数结构 $(\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,<)$ 均为标准结构。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"双类结构满足关系见 [[62-df-L2-model]]，句子见 [[62-df-L2]]。$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}$；数结构 $(\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,<)$ 均为标准结构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_2}^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,+,\\cdot,0,1,<)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}model}\\vdash\\;\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\mathcal S,+,\\cdot,0,1,<).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaStruct}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S})\\leftrightarrow\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}(\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S},T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{cases}\\bot&\\mathcal S=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}\\models T&\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1719,"backlinks":[{"id":"60af01126d249179","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$，$\\mathcal M_{\\mathcal S}$ 为 [[62-df-omega-model]] 中的候选元组；$\\mathcal S\\ne\\varnothing$ 时才是其 ω 结构。满足关系采用 [[62-df-L2-model]] 的元层递归；$\\Sigma^1_1(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；赋值的变量域见 [[62-df-L2]]。Assertion 的非空分支中 $g_N:V_N\\to\\mathbb N$、$g_S:V_S\\to\\mathcal S$。"},{"id":"0c16017ee3d857fa","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，数值截面见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；ω 模型见 [[62-df-omega-model]]。$T$ 是 $L_2$ 句子集合。"},{"id":"20465fe6fc759475","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"集合族、模型和理论见 [[62-df-REC-ARITH]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；最小性见 [[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]。"},{"id":"4b22e5dfc91ce477","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"集合族、模型、树与理论分别见 [[62-df-REC-ARITH]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-Tree]]、[[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-WKL0]]；最小模型事实见 [[62-thm-minimal-omega-models]]。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-52","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-omega-model|Omega Structures and Models]]"},{"id":"b6355356a3573e48","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$；$\\mathrm{ACA}_0$、$\\operatorname{OmegaModelOf}$、$\\mathsf{TIdeal}$、$\\mathsf J$ 见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-omega-model]]、[[62-df-turing-ideal]]、[[62-df-jump-operator]]。"},{"id":"9a759143ad2dba1b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_